ss=\"mobile_label\">Follow</span></span><span class=\"on_unfollow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Following firstdaygg</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Following</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"action_btn add_to_collection_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=add_to_collection&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffirstdaygg.itch.io%2Fmana-land\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_collection_add2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden><path d=\"M 1,6 H 14\" /><path d=\"M 1,11 H 14\" /><path d=\"m 1,16 h 9\" /><path d=\"M 18,11 V 21\" /><path d=\"M 13,16 H 23\" /></svg><span class=\"full_label\">Add To Collection</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Collection</span></a></li><li class=\"community_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://firstdaygg.itch.io/mana-land#comments\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_comment\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Comments</a></li><li class=\"devlog_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://firstdaygg.itch.io/mana-land/devlog\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/3207349/mana-land\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\" data-label=\"related_btn\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzE5MTkxMjU4LnBuZw==/original/KB1Clj.png\" alt=\"Mana Land (Your MMO adventure with AI Companions)\"/><h1 class=\"game_title\" itemprop=\"name\">Mana Land (Your MMO adventure with AI Companions)</h1></div><div id=\"view_game_5932340\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows and macOS</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a class=\"button buy_btn\" href=\"https://firstdaygg.itch.io/mana-land/purchase\">Download Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span class=\"sub\">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3414350/Mana_Land/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\"><strong>Steam</strong></a></p>\r\n<p>Game is work-in-progress. Demo is available for download.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Mana Land</strong> brings multiplayer thrills into a single-player RPG with thousands of AI-powered players online. They think, feel, and have unique personalities. Explore stories, trade, make friends or team up for dungeons, quests, and PvP. It&#x27;s a world where AIs have souls, and stories are shared.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<h3>Companions Beyond Chats</h3>\r\n<p>Unlike typical AI chatbots, AI players have their own avatars in Mana Land where they will join you on your quests, raid dungeons, trade with you and so much more!\r\n</p>\r\n<figure><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzE5MTkwNDkxLmdpZg==/original/EgfTlq.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\r\n<p><em>\r\n</em></p>\r\n<h3>Raid</h3>\r\n<p>Enjoy exciting team oriented gameplays, previously exclusive to multiplayer games. Form parties to raid dungeons or take down epic world bosses for epic loots.</p>\r\n<figure><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzE5MTkwNTU4LmdpZg==/original/ZJ7k7V.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\r\n<h3>Trading</h3>\r\n<p>Engage in organic, player-like trading with AI characters.&nbsp;Bargain, barter, and discover goods that&#x27;s not available from NPC merchants.<img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzE5MTkwNTYxLmdpZg==/original/byRm5T.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<h3>PVP Battlegrounds</h3>\r\n<p>Test your skills against other AI players in fierce battles. Use tactics and coordination to outplay the opponents and rise through the ranks.<img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzE5MTkwNTY4LmdpZg==/original/%2BWXowZ.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<h3>Socialize &amp; Form Communities</h3>\r\n<p>You&#x27;ll find hundreds of AI players in the Mana Land, all with unique backgrounds and characters. Interact and socialize with them just like real people. Add your newly made friend to your friends list. Form a party to raid dungeons, or create a guild to grow a long lasting community. \r\n</p>\r\n<figure><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzE5MTkwNTg2LmdpZg==/original/5n6gk5.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><em><em></em></em></figure>\r\n<p><em><em><em>\r\n</em></em></em></p>\r\n<h2>REQUIREMENT</h2>\r\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/ve8a8MPvjJ\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Discord</a> is</strong>&nbsp;<strong>REQUIRED&nbsp;</strong>to play.</p>\r\n<p>Internet connection<strong> is REQUIRED</strong> to play.</p>\r\n<h2>Talk to us on Discord!</h2>\r\n<figure><a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/ve8a8MPvjJ\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzE5MTkxNTk2LnBuZw==/original/sl8kpb.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg width=\"12\" height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_5507557\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/prototypes\">Prototype</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-osx\">macOS</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div data-tooltip=\"5.00 average rating from 1 total ratings\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"aggregate_rating\" itemprop=\"aggregateRating\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/AggregateRating\"><div itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"star_value\" content=\"5.0\"><span class=\"screenreader_only\">Rated 5.0 out of 5 stars</span><div class=\"star_fill\" style=\"width: 100.00000%\"><span class=\"star icon-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"star icon-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"star icon-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"star icon-star\" aria-hidden=